            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1358-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1358-f2-content">
                <p>According to the record copy of this memorandum, Tab A was telegram 268 from
                    Cairo, Aug. 29, <ref target="#d1357"><hi rendition="#italic"
                    >supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1358-f3" n="3" xml:id="d1358-f3-content">
                <p>Department of State officials had been given this information earlier that same
                    day in a conversation with R. W. Bailey, First Secretary of the British Embassy.
                    (Memorandum of Conversation, not printed. 474.418/8–3054)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
